{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
<style>
:root { --bg:#0f1720; --card:#0b1220; --accent:#8fbf8f; --muted:#9aa6b2; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); --accent2:#7ec0ff;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#07111a);color:#e6eef5;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat; background-size:400px;}
.container{width:min(1100px,94%);margin:3rem auto}
nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}
.brand{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.4px}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:1rem}
.navlinks a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px}
.navlinks a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--accent)}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:2rem;align-items:center;margin-top:2rem}
.card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(0,0,0,0.12));padding:1.2rem;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
h1{margin:0 0 0.4rem;font-size:1.6rem}
.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1rem}
.contact-form label{display:block;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:0.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
.contact-form input,.contact-form textarea{width:100%;padding:0.6rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit;margin-top:0.3rem;outline:none}
.contact-form .row{display:flex;gap:0.6rem}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#04201a;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.small{font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)}
.sidebar .meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.6rem}
.meta .item{display:flex;gap:0.6rem;align-items:center}
.badges{display:flex;gap:0.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0.8rem}
.badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);position:relative}
.badge button{background:none;border:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;padding:0;cursor:help}
.tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#011017;color:#bfe9c9;padding:0.5rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.78rem;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease}
.badge:focus-within .tooltip,.badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-4px)}
.proof{margin-top:1.2rem}
.testimonial{min-height:80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease;opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}
.testimonial.active{opacity:1;transform:none}
.testimonial p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.testimonial .who{margin-top:0.6rem;font-weight:600;color:#e6f6e9;font-size:0.9rem}
.controls{display:flex;gap:0.4rem;margin-top:0.6rem}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
.dot.active{background:var(--accent)}
.compare{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.6rem;margin-top:1rem}
.toggle{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:4px}
.toggle button{background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
.toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#022b23}
.price{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#e9f7ef}
.small-muted{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
.faq{margin-top:2rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem}
.faq .q{background:var(--glass);padding:0.9rem;border-radius:8px}
.footer{margin:3rem 0 5rem;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{margin:1.2rem auto}.sidebar{order:2}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<nav><div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div><div class="navlinks"><a href="index.html">Welcome</a><a href="services.html">Offerings</a><a href="blends.html">Blends</a><a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a><a href="pricing.html">Rates</a><a href="about.html">Who we are</a><a href="book.html">Reserve</a><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></div></nav>

<section class="hero">
<div>
<div class="card">
<h1>Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
<p class="lead">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
<form class="contact-form" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="get" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); handleContact();">
<label for="name">Name</label>
<input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
<label for="email">Email</label>
<input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
<label for="message">Message</label>
<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your interest, timing, and any pets or pregnancy notes"></textarea>
<div style="display:flex;gap:0.6rem;margin-top:0.8rem;align-items:center">
<button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
<a class="small" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Or email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
</div>
<p class="small-muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">By connecting you agree to a brief intake and safety review. Aromatherapy sessions are supportive and may support well-being; they are not a substitute for medical care.</p>
</form>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Proof & trust</h3>
<div class="meta">
<div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
<div class="badge" tabindex="0"><button aria-label="Certification info">Ethics Cert</button><div class="tooltip" role="note">Completed ethics training for safe aromatic practice</div></div>
<div class="badge" tabindex="0"><button aria-label="Association info">Aroma Guild</button><div class="tooltip" role="note">Member of the National Aromatherapy Guild</div></div>
<div class="badge" tabindex="0"><button aria-label="Local award info">Community Choice</button><div class="tooltip" role="note">Recognized by local wellness readers</div></div>
</div>

<div class="proof">
<div id="testimonials">
<div class="testimonial active" data-index="0"><p>"Gentle, guided sessions that helped me with evening routine — subtle yet steady change."</p><div class="who">— A. Rivera, {{CITY}}</div></div>
<div class="testimonial" data-index="1"><p>"Thoughtful blends that respect sensitivity and pets — recommended."</p><div class="who">— K. Thompson</div></div>
<div class="testimonial" data-index="2"><p>"Patient intake and clear safety guidance before any session."</p><div class="who">— S. Morgan</div></div>
</div>
<div class="controls" id="dots"></div>
</div>

</div>
</div>

<aside class="sidebar">
<div class="card">
<h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick Connect</h3>
<div class="small-muted">Call or text</div>
<div style="font-weight:700;margin:0.4rem 0">{{PHONE}}</div>
<div class="small-muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Email</div>
<div style="font-weight:700;margin:0.4rem 0">{{EMAIL}}</div>

<div class="compare">
<div class="small-muted">Select pricing view</div>
<div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
<button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
<button id="packBtn" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Package</button>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;margin-top:0.8rem;align-items:center">
<div style="flex:1" class="card">
<div class="small-muted">Aromatherapy Tune-up</div>
<div class="price" id="priceA">—</div>
<div class="small-muted">One-to-one session that may support mood & rest</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:1" class="card">
<div class="small-muted">Personal Blend Plan</div>
<div class="price" id="priceB">—</div>
<div class="small-muted">Custom blend + safety consult</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="small-muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Toggle will animate values to show relative cost between recurring support and single packages.</p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem">
<h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Hours & Visit</h4>
<div class="small-muted">By appointment in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
<a class="btn" href="book.html" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:0.6rem">Reserve a slot</a>
</div>

</aside>
</section>

<section class="faq container">
<div class="q card">
<h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Safety & Dilution</h4>
<p class="small-muted">All topical products are provided with recommended dilution ranges and instructions. Always patch-test any topical blend 24–48 hours prior to regular use. Avoid undiluted application.</p>
</div>
<div class="q card">
<h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Pets & Pregnant Clients</h4>
<p class="small-muted">We prioritize safety: share household pets and pregnancy or nursing status during intake so we can adapt blends and session methods. Some essential oils should be avoided around pets and during pregnancy.</p>
</div>
<div class="q card">
<h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Patch Test</h4>
<p class="small-muted">A small patch test on the inner forearm is recommended; discontinue if irritation occurs.</p>
</div>
<div class="q card">
<h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Non-medical Scope</h4>
<p class="small-muted">Aromatherapy is supportive and may support relaxation or focus. It is not medical treatment. For health conditions, consult a health care professional.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
<div class="card" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem">
<div>
<h3 style="margin:0 0 0.4rem">Ready to begin?</h3>
<p class="small-muted" style="margin:0 0 0.6rem">Book a consult to review goals, safety, and a plan that may support steady change.</p>
</div>
<div>
<a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></footer>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

// Testimonials rotate
const testimonials = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#testimonials .testimonial'));
const dots = document.getElementById('dots');
let current = 0;
testimonials.forEach((t,i)=>{
 const d = document.createElement('div');
 d.className='dot' + (i===0?' active':'');
 d.dataset.index = i;
 d.tabIndex = 0;
 d.setAttribute('role','button');
 d.addEventListener('click', ()=> show(i));
 d.addEventListener('keydown', e=> { if(e.key==='Enter') show(i);});
 dots.appendChild(d);
});
function show(i){
 testimonials[current].classList.remove('active');
 dots.children[current].classList.remove('active');
 current = i;
 testimonials[current].classList.add('active');
 dots.children[current].classList.add('active');
 resetTimer();
}
let timer = setInterval(()=>{ show((current+1)%testimonials.length); },5000);
function resetTimer(){ clearInterval(timer); timer = setInterval(()=>{ show((current+1)%testimonials.length); },5000); }

// Badges: tooltips handled via CSS focus/hover for accessibility

// Pricing comparator
const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
const packBtn = document.getElementById('packBtn');
const priceA = document.getElementById('priceA');
const priceB = document.getElementById('priceB');

const prices = {
 monthly: {A:48, B:68},
 pack: {A:120, B:180}
};
let view='monthly';
function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
 const startTime = performance.now();
 function tick(now){
  const elapsed = now - startTime;
  const progress = Math.min(elapsed / duration,1);
  const value = Math.round(start + (end - start) * progress);
  el.textContent = '$' + value;
  if(progress < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
 }
 requestAnimationFrame(tick);
}
function switchTo(mode){
 if(mode===view) return;
 view = mode;
 monthlyBtn.classList.toggle('active', mode==='monthly');
 packBtn.classList.toggle('active', mode==='pack');
 monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', mode==='monthly');
 packBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', mode==='pack');
 // animate numbers
 const curA = parseInt(priceA.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||0;
 const curB = parseInt(priceB.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''))||0;
 const targetA = prices[mode].A;
 const targetB = prices[mode].B;
 animateValue(priceA, curA, targetA, 600);
 animateValue(priceB, curB, targetB, 600);
}
monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=> switchTo('monthly'));
packBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=> switchTo('pack'));
// initialize
priceA.textContent = '$' + prices[view].A;
priceB.textContent = '$' + prices[view].B;

// contact handling
window.handleContact = function(){
 const n=document.getElementById('name').value||'';
 const e=document.getElementById('email').value||'';
 alert('Thanks ' + n + '. We will reach out to ' + e + ' shortly. You may also call ' + '{{PHONE}}');
};
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"}
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and micro features for the aromatherapy site (chunk 4)

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html : Complete contact page with local JavaScript and CSS. Contains the Proof Gallery, credibility badges with accessible tooltips, and a Pricing Comparator micro-interaction (monthly vs package) with animated numbers.

Purpose and highlights:
- Proof Gallery: Rotating testimonials in the right-hand card. Dots below the testimonials allow manual selection, and rotation auto-advances every 5s. Credibility badges show short explanatory tooltips on hover and keyboard focus.
- Pricing Comparator: Toggle between "Monthly" and "Package" views. Prices animate numerically to the new values to make comparisons feel alive. Values are seeded in the script and can be adjusted.
- Contact form: Uses placeholders for integration: {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PHONE}}. The sample handler prevents default submission and shows a lightweight confirmation; replace with your form endpoint as needed.
- Safety-forward copy: The page includes FAQ items and guidance (dilution, patch test, pets, pregnancy, non-medical scope) in line with aromatherapy safety rules.

Placeholders to replace in template:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes for implementers:
- assets/img/pattern.svg is referenced as a local background pattern. Create a unique SVG at that path to satisfy the site-wide uniqueness requirement.
- The nav uses a slightly different label set: Welcome, Offerings, Blends, Apothecary, Rates, Who we are, Reserve, Connect. Adjust links if you rename pages.
- Testimonials, badge text, and pricing values are inline in contact.html for easy editing.
- Accessibility: badges expose tooltips on :focus and :hover; testimonial controls are keyboard accessible and use ARIA-friendly attributes.

Testing tips:
- Open contact.html in a browser. Verify the testimonial rotation, badge tooltips on hover and tab focus, and the pricing toggle animating the numbers.
- Replace placeholders with real values and update PRIMARY_CTA_URL to wire the form to a booking or CRM endpoint.

Caveats:
- No external fonts or CDNs are used. Keep assets local.
- The contact form currently uses a simple JS alert for demo. Hook it to your backend or replace the form action as required.

If you need an accompanying assets/img/pattern.svg or additional pages from the site (index, services, blends, shop, pricing, about, book), request the next chunk and I will produce them with the unique SVG and matching styles."}
BUNDLE_END
